title: Authorizations › New case › Save as draft and leave
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId, then /manager
intro: A case becomes a draft in Case Manager once it is saved, which happens on 'Save as draft' and also on 'Start the agents'. Leaving without saving leaves nothing in Case Manager. Opening a saved draft puts the person back where the case was.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Working on a new case"

group gSave "Ways a draft gets saved"
  click c1 "Click 'Save as draft' on step 2 'Medical records'"
  click c2 "Click 'Save as draft' on step 4 'Review and sign'"
  click c3 "Click 'Start the agents' on step 2\nNo toast is shown"
  process pNo3 "Step 3 'Agents work' has no 'Save as draft' button\nThe run itself saved the case"
endgroup

decision dAlready "Is the case already saved?"
store st1 "Draft marked saved and given a case ID\nR- for Residential 3.5 and Detox, I- for IOP, P- for PHP\nNumbered from 1701"
process pNoop "Nothing changes; the toast still shows"
toast t1 "Step 2: 'Draft saved'\n'R-1701 is in Case Manager. Pick it up whenever you like.'"
toast t2 "Step 4: 'Draft saved'\n'R-1701 is in Case Manager, ready to sign.'"

click cLeave "Click 'Case Manager' at the top, a sidebar item, or close the tab"
decision dSaved "Was the case saved?"
process pUnsaved "Nothing appears in Case Manager\nThe draft stays in this session and its address still opens it\nOpening New case again starts another blank draft"
process pAway "A running case stops moving while the page is closed\nThe row shows the agent that was working"

screen sCM "Case Manager › Active cases › Being prepared\n'Most urgent first. Each case moves through eight steps; the agents do all but Ask and Sign.'\nFilter: 'All', 'Agents working', 'Needs your input', 'Ready to sign'"
screen sRow "A row for the draft\nLevel of care chip, case ID, 'J.M., 34 · Summit Medicaid HMO', request\nEight-step bar: Read, Rules, Match, Ask, Draft, Check, Sign, Send\nWho has it, due chip, status pill, approval chance, one button"
decision dState "What state is the draft in?"
process rIntake "'Intake not finished'\nButton 'Continue'; chance shows 'Not started'"
process rWork "'Agents working'\nButton 'Watch'"
process rAsk "'Needs your input'\nButton 'Answer'"
process rReady "'Ready to sign'\nButton 'Review and sign'"
process pBadge "The sidebar badge on 'Case Manager' counts drafts that need a person\nIntake not finished, a question, or ready to sign"
process pDash "The Dashboard shows nothing for a new draft until it is signed and sent\nSeeded cases such as R-1042 do show under 'Preparing'"
click cOpen "Click the case ID, or the row's button"
process pResume "Opens /authorizations/new/DRAFT\nThe page resumes where the draft was"
goto gResume "Continues in: Agents work › Finished, paused or left"
goto gStep2 "Continues in: Medical records › The checklist and Continue"

screen sNF "New case\n'That draft is not in the demo.'\n'We could not find that draft'\n'It may have been cleared when the demo data was reset.'"
click cNew "Click 'Start a new case'"
process pNew "A new blank draft opens on step 1"
goto gRef "Continues in: New case › Referral step"

s1 --> c1
s1 --> c2
s1 --> c3
s1 --> pNo3
c1 --> dAlready
c2 --> dAlready
c3 --> dAlready
dAlready -->|No| st1
dAlready -->|Yes| pNoop
c1 --> t1
c2 --> t2
st1 --> sCM

s1 --> cLeave --> dSaved
dSaved -->|No| pUnsaved
dSaved -->|Yes| sCM
dSaved -->|Yes, running| pAway --> sCM
pUnsaved -.-> sNF

sCM --> sRow --> dState
dState -->|Intake not finished| rIntake
dState -->|Agents working| rWork
dState -->|Question open| rAsk
dState -->|Signature needed| rReady
sCM --> pBadge
sCM --> pDash
rIntake --> cOpen
rWork --> cOpen
rAsk --> cOpen
rReady --> cOpen
cOpen --> pResume
pResume --> gResume
pResume --> gStep2

sNF --> cNew --> pNew --> gRef
